            "line": 742,
            "text": "theorem model_estimate (F : Profile) :\n    ∃ r L : ℝ, 0 < r ∧ 0 ≤ L ∧ ∀ v : Control, ‖v‖ ≤ r → ∀ p ∈ window,\n      (v, p) ∈ regular F ∧ ‖observations F (v, p) - observations F (0, p)‖ ≤ L * ‖v‖"
